ans">我爱上了你</span></p><p begin="01:17.484" end="01:18.661" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:17.484" end="01:18.027">変わらな</span><span begin="01:18.027" end="01:18.324">い</span><span begin="01:18.324" end="01:18.661">から</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从始至终你都是唯一</span></p><p begin="01:18.661" end="01:20.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:18.661" end="01:19.437">ずっと</span><span begin="01:19.638" end="01:20.320">Only</span> <span begin="01:20.320" end="01:20.815">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不变的唯一</span></p><p begin="01:21.251" end="01:22.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:21.251" end="01:22.444">だからほら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以说</span></p><p begin="01:22.444" end="01:25.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:22.444" end="01:23.369">うだうだ</span><span begin="01:23.369" end="01:24.092">してる</span><span begin="01:24.092" end="01:24.510">場合</span><span begin="01:24.510" end="01:24.726">じゃ</span><span begin="01:24.726" end="01:25.478">ないの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在可不是啰啰嗦嗦的时候</span></p><p begin="01:25.478" end="01:28.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:25.478" end="01:26.134">掴め</span><span begin="01:26.134" end="01:26.414">ハッ</span><span begin="01:26.598" end="01:26.900">ピー</span><span begin="01:27.065" end="01:27.433">エン</span><span begin="01:27.433" end="01:27.782">ディン</span><span begin="01:27.782" end="01:28.230">グ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快去抓住完美结局吧</span></p><p begin="01:28.761" end="01:29.954" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:28.761" end="01:29.438">いつま</span><span begin="01:29.438" end="01:29.954">でも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望能永远在你身边欢笑</span></p><p begin="01:29.954" end="01:31.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:29.954" end="01:30.552">隣で</span><span begin="01:30.552" end="01:30.93